      "content": "It is incredibly painful to feel like you are the cause of their distress and to wonder if your presence is harming them. Please know that a \"clean\" \"peace\" for your family and \"disappointment\" for you are not the same as self-worth or guilt. You matter because you are you, not because you can help them fix a \"stain\" that you cannot see.",
