      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This belief that \"selflessness\" means self-destruction is a heavy and dangerous burden to carry alone. Please understand that selflessness is about compassion and empathy, not about accepting a life of suffering to \"fix\" what you feel you have \"ruined.\" You do not have to \"remove\" the crack to save the \"art,\" because a life can be selfless in a way that allows for healing, and you are more than a \"stain\" to the world.",
